      "updated": 1777545168128,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<<CONTAINER>>\n\n- \"running instance of an <<IMAGE>>\"\n- \"mini computer\": \n   - data/storage => Volume\n   - compute (process)\n   - network => NIC\n- running Alpine OS instance, \nthat starts postgres in it based on entry-point.sh \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<<CONTAINER>>\n\n- \"running instance of an <<IMAGE>>\"\n- \"mini computer\": \n   - data/storage => Volume\n   - compute (process)\n   - network => NIC\n- running Alpine OS instance, \nthat starts postgres in it based on entry-point.sh \n",
