      "text": "<<Port mapping>>\n\nPort mapping ensures that published ports \nare accessible on the host's network addresses, \nwhich are likely to be routable for any external clients. \nNo routes are normally set up in the host's network for container addresses that exist within a host.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<<Port mapping>>\n\nPort mapping ensures that published ports \nare accessible on the host's network addresses, \nwhich are likely to be routable for any external clients. \nNo routes are normally set up in the host's network for container addresses that exist within a host.",
